  "description": "Fuselage: white forward, silver-gray aft of a slanting edge just ahead of the tail. Cheatlines: none. Tail: orange fin with a big white disc toward the trailing edge, a gray crescent behind it; below the fin an orange lobe and a white crescent sweep down onto the gray rear fuselage, like the O of the logo drawn large. Engines: silver-gray. Titles: a huge orange 'GOL' across the forward fuselage, its O carrying a gray inner crescent. Artwork: none beyond the wordmark.",
